<title>USA: St Paul hogs $.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs $.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts traded slow, $.50 higher. Top $55.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs     55.00</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs     54.50-55.00</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs     53.50-54.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs     52.50-53.50</p>
<p>Sows: Under 550 lbs .50 to 1.00 higher; over 550 lbs 1.00 to 2.00 higher. Top 56.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-400 lbs     44.50</p>
<p>	     400-500 lbs     46.50-49.50</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs     53.00</p>
<p>	     550-700 lbs     56.00</p>
</text>
